ID         ! Model ID                                                       > WATERS
NNODES     ! Number of axial nodes                                          > 100
FLUID      ! Fluid ID                                                       > water
PROPERTIES ! Fluid property assumptions                                     > saturated
FRICTION   ! Wall friction coefficients                                     > 0.2 -0.2 0.0
TPFM       ! Two-phase friction multiplier [-]                              > homogeneous
KLOC       ! Elevation of local perturbations [m]                           > 1   2   3
KLOSS      ! corresponding pressure loss coefficients [-]                   > 0.5 0.5 0.5
TPKM       ! Two-phase local loss multiplier [-]                            > homogeneous
SCBOIL     ! Subcooled boiling model                                        > none
VOID       ! Void fraction model                                            > slip
SLIP       ! Phase velocity ratio [-]                                       > 1
END

